§§ `ss 108, 109 -- going to court`

-- Accident on 1 March 2015: three years end on 1 March 2018.
-- Arguments: accident; death; day of death; referred; when; certificate issued; when.
#ASSERT `What is the last day to commence proceedings without leave` (`d` 1 3 2015) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` EQUALS JUST (`d` 1 3 2018)
