§§ `s 110 -- notice to commence proceedings`

-- Accident 1 January 2015; entitled from 1 May 2016; notice received 1 November 2016 (6 months entitled, 22 months since
-- the accident): the three months end on 1 February 2017.
-- Arguments: accident; entitled from; notice received; commenced; when; today; reinstated.
#ASSERT `Is my claim withdrawn for not commencing proceedings` (`d` 1 1 2015) (`d` 1 5 2016) (`d` 1 11 2016) TRUE (`d` 1 2 2017) (`d` 1 3 2017) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my claim withdrawn for not commencing proceedings` (`d` 1 1 2015) (`d` 1 5 2016) (`d` 1 11 2016) TRUE (`d` 2 2 2017) (`d` 1 3 2017) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
